<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19372" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾶρις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>
			(also-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			J.
			<u>AJ</u>
			14.16.2
		</span></i>, cf.<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Et.Gud.,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AB
				84
			</span></i>), 
				Ion.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἡ</span>:
			acc. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾶριν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					10.11.7
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				6.5
			</span></i>; dat. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάρει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					11.4.6
				</span></i>
			: pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάρεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>2 Ch.</u>
					36.19
				</span></i>
			, al., 
				Ion.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάριες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.41
				</span></i>
			; gen. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαρέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ps.</u>
					44(45).8
				</span></i>
			; poet. dat. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαρίδεσσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					553
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.):—<i>flat-bottomed boat,</i> used in Egypt,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				874
			</span></i>(lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.41
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				96
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				179
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHib.</u>
				100.13
			</span></i><span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Aed.</u>
				1.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάρβαροι βάριδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IA</u>
					297
				</span></i>
			(lyr.); of Odysseus' <i>raft,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				747
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> later,
				<i>large house, tower,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ps.</u>
				44(45).8
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				<u>Da.</u>
				8.2
			</span></i>,al.,J.ll.cc., Kalinka <i>Antike Denkmälerin
				Bulgarien</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				142
			</span></i> (Apollonia, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέγεται β. ἡ οἰκία, ὡς Ποσείδιππος,
					καὶ ἡ συνοικία ὡς Ἔφορος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					St.Byz.
				</span></i>
			 (Egyptian word.)</div>
